   "title": "Rays at the ends",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&\\tan\\dfrac\\pi3=\\sqrt3\\ \\Rightarrow\\ y=\\sqrt3\\,(x-4)\\quad(\\theta=\\tfrac\\pi3)\\\\[5pt]&y=-\\sqrt3\\,(x-4)\\quad(\\theta=-\\tfrac\\pi3)\\end{aligned}\\]",
