   "title": "Between the rays",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&\\text{Angles between $-60^\\circ$ and $60^\\circ$}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{lie to the right of $4$, so $x>4$ and}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{$|y|\\le\\sqrt3(x-4)$.}\\end{aligned}\\]",
